    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Alchemic Beasts: Restore Mizu, Tame Beasts, and Unleash The Power Of Alchemy!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/314f81c0b8a6e8219658afc5768aa96c.avif?t=1747346689\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Zieg and Mioni in Alchemic Beasts, a thrilling monster taming adventure where they seek revenge and restoration in the paradise of Mizu. After a dangerous encounter, Zieg is revived by Mioni to tame unruly beasts, reclaim Mizu, and bring back its lost paradise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/68e41c871a28c00d42d99fe62f9be4a4.avif?t=1747346689\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.poster.avif?t=1747346689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.webm?t=1747346689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.mp4?t=1747346689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Tactical Combat:</strong></i> Use elemental abilities to stagger enemies. Open them up for powerful attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Stagger System:</strong></i> Engage in strategic battles using the Stagger System. Stagger foes to unleash devastating attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/e1d732a8db82ba105d834c7e60a70eb1.avif?t=1747346689\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.poster.avif?t=1747346689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.webm?t=1747346689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.mp4?t=1747346689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Capture and Evolve Beasts:</strong></i> Use alchemy to capture over 200 unique beasts. Evolve them with elemental ores and turn them into powerful allies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Forge Bonds:</strong></i> Build strong bonds with your beat to merge and evolve them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Master Alchemy:</strong></i> Harvest and craft recourses to create alchemic potions and food to keep your monsters strong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Restore Mizu:</strong></i> Complete missions to reclaim Mizu. Bring back inhabitants and rebuild the town.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Alchemic Beasts: Restore Mizu, Tame Beasts, and Unleash The Power Of Alchemy!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/314f81c0b8a6e8219658afc5768aa96c.avif?t=1747346689\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Zieg and Mioni in Alchemic Beasts, a thrilling monster taming adventure where they seek revenge and restoration in the paradise of Mizu. After a dangerous encounter, Zieg is revived by Mioni to tame unruly beasts, reclaim Mizu, and bring back its lost paradise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/68e41c871a28c00d42d99fe62f9be4a4.avif?t=1747346689\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.poster.avif?t=1747346689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.webm?t=1747346689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/03058128460cd66585543ee80685646d.mp4?t=1747346689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Tactical Combat:</strong></i> Use elemental abilities to stagger enemies. Open them up for powerful attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Stagger System:</strong></i> Engage in strategic battles using the Stagger System. Stagger foes to unleash devastating attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/e1d732a8db82ba105d834c7e60a70eb1.avif?t=1747346689\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.poster.avif?t=1747346689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.webm?t=1747346689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303850/extras/18b3fe322212be49f8f13b1da9e29980.mp4?t=1747346689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Capture and Evolve Beasts:</strong></i> Use alchemy to capture over 200 unique beasts. Evolve them with elemental ores and turn them into powerful allies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Forge Bonds:</strong></i> Build strong bonds with your beat to merge and evolve them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Master Alchemy:</strong></i> Harvest and craft recourses to create alchemic potions and food to keep your monsters strong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Restore Mizu:</strong></i> Complete missions to reclaim Mizu. Bring back inhabitants and rebuild the town.</p></li></ul>",
